	workflowConflictPolicy: { description: "`new-version` updates matching workflows and creates a new version; the archived state follows the package, so a matching workflow is archived or unarchived to match it. `fail` rejects the import when any matching workflow exists, and `skip` leaves matching workflows unchanged. Archived workflows in the target project match like any other. An archive state change also needs the `workflow:delete` scope." },
