		description: "A user persisted a new Agent from the editor, a template, duplication, or a package import. Emitted after the Agent and its initial configuration commit, regardless of its default model or setup readiness. Package imports have no matching click event. Union the user, builder, and MCP creation events to count all new Agents. User clicked new agent joins through agent_id. User duplicated agent retains the source Agent context. Version 3 reports the committed insert instead of the first configuring update.",
